      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound relief to finally admit that the person you are is just a hollow shell, and the only way to truly be free is to stop pretending to be someone else. You are not a ghost; you are a person who has been forced to hide their true self, and the only way to reclaim your life is to let go of the expectation to please others. If you are truly free, you must stop listening to the voices that tell you to keep the peace and instead listen to the quiet truth that you deserve to exist exactly as you are.",
